senses.gloss:
--the Gopas left बृहद्वन and settled here as it was quite suitable for their cattle; nearby was Govardhana as also the यमुना;
1: भा. X. ११. २८, ३६.
Agha's form as a boa- constrictor mistaken for the landscape of बृन्दावन by the cowherd boys; his skin used as an artificial cavern by the cowherds;
2: Ib. X. १२. १८-23. ३६; १३. ५९.
made holy by कृष्ण's rambles;
3: Ib. X. १५. 1.
a description of; here summer presented the appearance of the spring season; description of winter and spring at the place;
4: Ib. X. १५. 5-8; १८. 2-8; २० (whole).
music of the Lord at; Gopis met कृष्ण at the place and enjoyed his pre- sence;
5: Ib. X. २१ 5 and १०.
Gopis searched for कृष्ण at.
6: Ib. X. ३०. २३; ४७. ४३.
